      "id": 340457,
      "username": "avc",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2022-10-02T22:35:59.692Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Education module is an app (separated app now) that let you manage a school or any educational center (students, instructors, enrollments) and it’s integrated with ERPNext.</p>\n<p>LMS is a Learning Management software, as Moodle, Chamilo and others … able to create and manage learning contents itself (on line courses, lessons, evaluation, etc …)</p>\n<p>Hope this helps.</p>",
